"        <li>Check your manuscript’s file(s). If any file needs changes, "
"please go back and click “submit revision”.</li>\n"
"        <li>\n"
"          Add a cover letter (text and/or file) to the editor in charge, "
"which the editor in charge may choose to share with any selected "
