"the resubmission</strong> to avoid losing its content.\n"
"        </li>\n"
"        <li>\n"
"          Check the box in the “Finishing up” section\n"
"        </li>\n"
"        <li>\n"
"          Click “Upload”.\n"
"        </li>\n"
"      </ol>\n"
"      Please make sure you <strong>save any updates to the metadata and the "
"cover letter to avoid losing their content</strong>.\n"
"    "
